    "https://www.tesu.edu/why-tesu/career-focused-programs.php": {
      "title": "Career-Focused Programs",
      "description": "Career-Focused Programs | Thomas Edison State University Skip to main content Return to home Higher Education. For Adults with Higher Expectations. Info For Prospective Students Current Students Military Students Community College Students Alumni Donors Corporate Partners | Request Info | Apply Now | myEdison | What are you looking for? Request Info | Apply Now | myEdison | What are you looking for? Search Degrees & Programs Degrees & Programs Find Your Program Courses Schools Why TESU? Why TESU? Save Time & Money Finish Your Degree Anywhere Generous Credit Transfer Career-Focused Programs Accreditations Hear From Our Grads Admissions Admissions Methods of Earning Credit Admission Requirements Transfer Pathways Steps to Apply Speak with an Admissions Counselor Apply Now Tuition & Financial Aid Tuition & Financial Aid Costs & Fees Financial Aid Scholarships Student Resources Student Resources Register for Courses Academic Advising Academic Calendars Student Accessibility Military & Veteran Resources Transfer Credits to TESU Career Development About TESU About TESU Our History Fast Facts Our Campus Leadership & Departments Read Our Blog Visit the Newsroom Events Info For Prospective Students Current Students Military Students Community College Students Alumni Donors Corporate Partners | Request Info | Apply Now | myEdison | Request Info | Apply Now | myEdison | Career-Focused Programs Why TESU? Career-Focused Programs Why TESU? Save Time & Money Finish Your Degree Anytime, Anywhere Generous Credit Transfer Career-Focused Programs Accreditation and Licensure Contact Us 111 W. State St. Trenton, NJ 08608 admissions@tesu.edu (609) 777-5680 Forge your path to career advancement In today’s dynamic and competitive job market, continuous learning and professional development are essential to excelling in your career. At Thomas Edison State University (TESU), we offer a wide range of high-quality, career-focused online academic degree and certificate programs to provide working adults with the knowledge you need to advance in your field without sacrificing your personal or professional responsibilities. Why Choose TESU for Your Career Goals? For more than 50 years, TESU has been helping busy adults like you increase their marketability and achieve their goals in a supportive, online learning environment. With more than 100 flexible degree programs, industry-relevant certifications and ongoing support, we can help you unlock new opportunities, grow your career and put your goals within reach — all at your own pace. And because of our partnerships with many respected companies and organizations across the globe, you may be able to take advantage of reduced tuition rates. Explore Career-Centered Programs Your goals are unique, and TESU offers numerous career-building, resume-relevant programs to help you achieve them. Immerse yourself in many of our high-demand career programs such as business, cybersecurity, nursing, information technology and healthcare and take your achievement to the next level. Explore the reasons why so many adults around the world choose TESU for their professional advancement and personal fulfillment. Find Your Program Industry-Focused Curriculum When it comes to staying ahead in today’s competitive job market, you need access to high-quality, innovative, accredited college programs that meet the unique needs of your industry. For more than 50 years, TESU has been crafting rigorous and industry-relevant programs for working adults that are informed by advisory boards comprised of leaders in their fields. Corporate Partners TESU is honored to partner with some of the largest and most respected companies and organizations to bring career-building education to employees across the globe. As an employee of one of our corporate partners, you may be able to pursue your college degree in a setting designed exclusively for working adults like you. About Corporate Partners Career Services & Support at TESU When you pursue a degree at TESU, you have ongoing access to our Academic Advisors who are here to be your primary support contact throughout your entire academic journey. Plus, our Office of Career Development is available to assist you with your career and educational goals to help ensure you have the tools to succeed no matter where you are in the world. Explore Career Development Obtaining my degrees opened a lot of doors and positioned me for the most important role of my career.\" Altereek Stembridge M.S. '21, BSBA '19 Read Altereek's story Ready to Apply? Advancing your career is within reach and we’re dedicated to supporting you every step of the way. Just follow our guide to start your application today. Apply Now Keep Exploring Graduate Programs Graduate Admissions Undergraduate Programs Undergraduate Admissions To Top Request Info Find Your Program Apply Now Also of Interest: Generous Credit Transfer 17 Common Questions Everyone Has About PLA, Answered Empowering Community College Transfer Students 111 W. State St. Trenton, NJ 08608 admissions@tesu.edu 609-777-5680 Newsroom Events University Store Careers at TESU Contact Us Give/Donate ©Copyright 2026 All Rights Reserved Privacy Policy Policies & Procedures Compliance Info Web Accessibility Sitemap"
